 * Adds a new column to a dataframe by splitting values from an existing column
 * @param {dfd.DataFrame} df0 - The input dataframe
 * @param {string} sourceColumn - The column to split from (var0)
 * @param {string} targetColumn - The new column name (var1)
 * @param {string|RegExp} delimiter - The delimiter to split by (default: comma)
 * @param {number} index - Which part to extract after split (default: 0 for first part)
